</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/cfefa95a-e518-11f1-b6ef-13439ca2fe89/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-19T230006Z-1256675834-RC2WQOACA4BG-RTRMADP-3-CYBERSECURITY-DRONES-RISK.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/cfefa95a-e518-11f1-b6ef-13439ca2fe89/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-19T230006Z-1256675834-RC2WQOACA4BG-RTRMADP-3-CYBERSECURITY-DRONES-RISK.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6a8d1624-e513-11f1-bcb6-1d361a2029ae</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:42:58 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Gavin LEE</dc:creator></item><item><category>Middle East</category><title>Yemen's Houthis target Riyadh after Saudi coalition's 'special operation'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261120-yemen-s-houthis-target-riyadh-after-saudi-coalition-s-special-operation</link><description>
